" ghpr setup  Welcome                                                            "
"Set up ghpr?                                                                    "
"There's no config file yet (~/.config/ghpr/config.toml).                        "
"gh is logged in to 2 GitHub accounts (me-work, me). Without setup, ghpr uses    "
"gh's active one, me-work, everywhere.                                           "
"                                                                                "
"› Set up now                                                                    "
"  Skip                                                                          "
"                                                                                "
"                                                                                "
"                                                                                "
"                                                                                "
"                                                                                "
"                                                                                "
"                                                                                "
"                                                                                "
"                                                                                "
"┌ Preview ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│Setup asks:                                                                   │"
"│  • which accounts to use, with a profile for each                            │"
"│  • where each profile applies (directories, git email)                       │"
"│  • whose team review requests to include                                     │"
"│  • which view to open with                                                   │"
"│  • which accounts are bots                                                   │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│Nothing is written until you confirm. Skip writes a short starter config so   │"
"│this doesn't come up again; `ghpr config init` runs setup any time.           │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
" ↑↓ choose · Enter confirm · Esc not now · Ctrl-C quit                          "
